  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Household technology BOP USAID - Household technology BOP</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Hush&#xe5;llsprodukter BOP USAID</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The roll out of eco-friendly household products for the BOP such as   solar panels, cook stoves, water filters is limited by the            availability of working capital for companies in the value chain.     This intervention will facilitate access to capital for these         companies by a Sida/USAID co-guaranteesfor loans in this sector. The  intervention is for a planned subsidy of the guarantee premium.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Utrullningen av milj&#xf6;v&#xe4;nliga hush&#xe5;llsprodukter f&#xf6;r BOP som t.ex.      solceller, spisar, vattenfilter begr&#xe4;nsas bl.a av tillg&#xe5;ngen p&#xe5;       r&#xf6;relsekapital f&#xf6;r f&#xf6;retag inom v&#xe4;rdekedjan. Denna insats ska         underl&#xe4;tta tillg&#xe5;ngen till r&#xf6;relsekapital f&#xf6;r dessa f&#xf6;retag genom att Sida och USAID garanterar l&#xe5;n till f&#xf6;retag fr&#xe5;n ett antala utvalda    institutioner. Insatsen &#xe4;r f&#xf6;r en planerad subvention av premie</narrative>
  </description>
